	<item>
		<title>By: Akbar and Aziza Scott</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=820&#038;cpage=1#comment-8272</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Akbar and Aziza Scott]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 24 May 2011 16:43:32 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=820#comment-8272</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[For so many years Poul has been a steadfast friend on our journey together towards Beauty.  His wry sense of humour always managed to bring light into life and his loving manner
brought  warmth to our hearts. He had a special way of seeing the Beauty on earth and reflecting it in his manner and his watercolors.  May Peace and God&#039;s Glory be your eternal resting place!]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>For so many years Poul has been a steadfast friend on our journey together towards Beauty.  His wry sense of humour always managed to bring light into life and his loving manner<br />
brought  warmth to our hearts. He had a special way of seeing the Beauty on earth and reflecting it in his manner and his watercolors.  May Peace and God&#8217;s Glory be your eternal resting place!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
